{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":29578,\"title\":\"The Seven-Per-Cent Solution\",\"tagline\":\"The story is true...only the facts have been made up.\",\"overview\":\"Concerned about his friend's cocaine use, Dr. Watson tricks Sherlock Holmes into travelling to Vienna, where Holmes enters the care of Sigmund Freud. Freud attempts to solve the mysteries of Holmes' subconscious, while Holmes devotes himself to solving a mystery involving the kidnapping of Lola Deveraux.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wvrFj27OmsrTC04n57huYciFFPT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uRJ7DCHEpAAK1cLFRxgZqlCODep.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"voteCount\":117,\"year\":1976,\"runtime\":113,\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":5000000,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Herbert Ross\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":18378,\"name\":\"Herbert Ross\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mnPjBUHjwFEVpVk1KjGLxwgcgaR.jpg\"},{\"id\":1903,\"name\":\"Alan Arkin\",\"character\":\"Dr. Sigmund Freud\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AoMhBzvWMy8bAz14KdbQ30SF0RZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":13333,\"name\":\"Vanessa Redgrave\",\"character\":\"Lola Deveraux\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hBsjc7cW1DA0V6APwe3A7ESH3Lv.jpg\"},{\"id\":3087,\"name\":\"Robert Duvall\",\"character\":\"Dr. John H. Watson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3tcKxC5Sc3DJ6XPDKKC2EAomEWn.jpg\"},{\"id\":51812,\"name\":\"Nicol Williamson\",\"character\":\"Sherlock Holmes\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hCGo3mIwSIE9VDOALwEfZUN7BGw.jpg\"},{\"id\":3359,\"name\":\"Laurence Olivier\",\"character\":\"Professor James Moriarty\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kziWbtgEJB0dFZA6kPyzoaYEyQ5.jpg\"},{\"id\":6748,\"name\":\"Joel Grey\",\"character\":\"Lowenstein\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/JTvL1BdxNErOj0r5HOCiYdEjuc.jpg\"},{\"id\":46780,\"name\":\"Samantha Eggar\",\"character\":\"Mary Morstan Watson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Vbk8DHrsowKNG5wWuFzKOk26OR.jpg\"},{\"id\":55037,\"name\":\"Jeremy Kemp\",\"character\":\"Baron Karl von Leinsdorf\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lXKzFH9PM3H0JDlRcgMkw6FWq3i.jpg\"},{\"id\":10074,\"name\":\"Charles Gray\",\"character\":\"Mycroft Holmes\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3H5YbhDgZq9fUk12aKm82wgDFsk.jpg\"},{\"id\":32105,\"name\":\"Régine\",\"character\":\"Madame\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dCbrL9UopJv89lanVyxzzl95Pco.jpg\"},{\"id\":10599,\"name\":\"Anna Quayle\",\"character\":\"Freda\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AbwkoWmGWY0PmaOTaLjCQVBfkoO.jpg\"},{\"id\":104311,\"name\":\"Georgia Brown\",\"character\":\"Mrs. Freud\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yI2YvQaDH9ksGRezrNyPwrgxA4Y.jpg\"},{\"id\":103727,\"name\":\"Jill Townsend\",\"character\":\"Mrs. Holmes\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r0nqtyz4Isdojy6Rg8gxfoWjox8.jpg\"},{\"id\":172310,\"name\":\"John Bird\",\"character\":\"Berger\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cAtuYyuvaoQoxQOfSoiDqDfqbFc.jpg\"},{\"id\":31942,\"name\":\"Alison Leggatt\",\"character\":\"Mrs. Hudson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p8dUhLY6n9p33f2YrwBZHvILxzx.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1288059,\"title\":\"I Want Your Sex\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pR7SIX3AwqdoD96OI44oLG98e7g.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/34z9eBtEBv6QoroLuUA55cU3e8Q.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a naive young man becomes the sexual muse for a renowned and provocative artist, his dream job quickly turns dangerous as he is drawn into an obsessive world of power, betrayal, and murder.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":812583,\"title\":\"Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iV9LM8aUb83BjCCx2RUnKE5sSQg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fiRDzpcJe7qz3yIR43hdXIE3NHv.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When young priest Jud Duplenticy is sent to assist charismatic firebrand Monsignor Jefferson Wicks, it’s clear that all is not well in the pews. After a sudden and seemingly impossible murder rocks the town, the lack of an obvious suspect prompts local police chief Geraldine Scott to join forces with renowned detective Benoit Blanc to unravel a mystery that defies all logic.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":974573,\"title\":\"Another Simple Favor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zboCGZ4aIqPMd7VFI4HWnmc7KYJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b6e5Nss2QNoQM4wJv2VppChswNP.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Stephanie and Emily reunite on the beautiful island of Capri, Italy for Emily's extravagant wedding to a rich Italian businessman. Along with the glamorous guests, expect murder and betrayal to RSVP for a wedding with more twists and turns than the road from the Marina Grande to the Capri town square.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5236,\"title\":\"Kiss Kiss Bang Bang\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aWfjIkpENFX6Uw82pET7EQ6jnrd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kKdBNPXfjENj3wG5qtiCrZ2wflp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A petty thief posing as an actor is brought to Los Angeles for an unlikely audition and finds himself in the middle of a murder investigation along with his high school dream girl and a detective who's been training him for his upcoming role...\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10756,\"title\":\"The Haunted Mansion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lGi5yio4pdDz5PkSeZCbnMQz5vK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uUgn9P3Ulmjt9bOfp5Yt83fauAS.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Workaholic Jim Evers and his wife/business partner Sara get a call one night from  a mansion owner, Edward Gracey, who wants to sell his house. Once the Evers family arrive at the mansion, a torrential thunderstorm of mysterious origin strands them with the brooding, eccentric Gracey, his mysterious butler, and a variety of residents both seen and unseen.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":484247,\"title\":\"A Simple Favor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aIYsjQM0piKc0ibPBCTWv3sqshj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ugDSJKMEexMt1d38uyzRnVFsDIh.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Stephanie, a dedicated mother and popular vlogger, befriends Emily, a mysterious upper-class woman whose son Nicky attends the same school as Miles, Stephanie's son. When Emily asks her to pick Nicky up from school and then disappears, Stephanie undertakes an investigation that will dive deep into Emily's cloudy past.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":121875,\"title\":\"In the House\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6NCBSCCcyef9aNcABsVGZwuehSC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rSlu3MWZzOVBy6e6UEw9mPLMzUO.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A sixteen-year-old boy insinuates himself into the house of a fellow student from his literature class and writes about it in essays for his French teacher. Faced with this gifted and unusual pupil, the teacher rediscovers his enthusiasm for his work, but the boy’s intrusion will unleash a series of uncontrollable events.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":345915,\"title\":\"Once Upon a Time in Venice\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5rr7tQfzS0ARqEea3W9SNSFGRzb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wJQowXYcpcujDJA2NAM1GSCZtM2.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Steve Ford is a private detective in Venice Beach, Calif., who's good with the ladies, bad with the punches and wild about his dog Buddy. When local thugs steal Buddy, Ford turns to Spyder, their devious leader, and forges an unlikely alliance. With help from his best friend, Steve pulls out the big guns to retrieve Spyder's stolen cash and cocaine and save Buddy.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1066298,\"title\":\"Full River Red\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kOoxkXTYTi4OipM5G97gK9jnYIk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lY6RkqchljFAS7MrylH4l1nGXIU.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During China's Song Dynasty, a mysterious murder occurs at Chancellor Quin Hui's palace after meeting delegates from the neighboring Jin Dynasty. The members become embroiled not just in a murder mystery, but a larger conspiracy concerning the fate of the empire.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":480001,\"title\":\"The Art of Self-Defense\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bTq793Qwl3tCXb94zrDPAwppbsC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cUkpSTVt0iUbIVFDxvUGs747OMW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Casey is attacked at random on the street and enlists in a local dojo led by a charismatic and mysterious Sensei in an effort to learn how to defend himself. What he uncovers is a sinister world of fraternity, violence and hypermasculinity and a woman fighting for her place in it.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":534780,\"title\":\"Andhadhun\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dy3K6hNvwE05siGgiLJcEiwgpdO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/73aKTjdQ46jpv3InqNVnV76Nl0K.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A series of mysterious events changes the life of a blind pianist who now must report a crime that was actually never witnessed by him.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":683340,\"title\":\"Vengeance\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n1SlTeEv3dNJB3gF9AHAVElQ6LO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jwFBzWabfWpnN9P5YIVVX5W8WUY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ben, a journalist from New York City, travels to West Texas in order to investigate the death of a girl he was hooking up with while recording a murder mystery podcast along the way.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"CxzoWxT2E2Y\",\"name\":\"The Seven Per Cent Solution Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}